  "purpose": "Canonical list of the Super App sections that the Direzione enables person by person (r100 scd_person_grants). A role is only a description: it opens nothing. Every account starts with the base sections; everything else is a per-person grant with a level and a perimeter.",
  "rules": [
    "A role (e.g. 'Dirigente annata 2015') is only a description: it opens nothing automatically.",
    "Every new account gets only the base sections: public pages, own profile, own card.",
    "The Direzione enables each section individually for each person, choosing level (READ/WRITE/APPROVE) and perimeter (ALL/OWN_TEAMS/OWN_SITE/OWN_CHILDREN/SELF).",
    "'Copia abilitazioni da' and 'Proponi in base al ruolo' are helpers: they never save on their own, the Direzione confirms.",
    "Hard blocks always stay: minors' health data, Safeguarding, nobody edits their own access, the club account is protected.",
    "Sections with hardBlocked=true are never granted here and scd_can always answers false for them: they keep their own dedicated flows.",
    "Sections with directionOnly=true are never granted here: only an active Direzione membership opens them.",
    "Sensitive sections require a written reason for every grant.",
    "A minor can only receive the SELF perimeter.",
    "Kept in sync with the latest migration that defines scd_section_catalog (r100, then r101 which appends the UD-113 sections and keeps every r100 entry identical) by apps/superapp/src/lib/person-grants.test.ts."
  ],
