    "rules": [
      "Every platform (ONE, CORE, GROW) always offers 'Crea ruolo vuoto': a new role starts with every section at 'Nessuno'.",
      "Only the Presidente and the Direttore Generale create, edit or deactivate roles (r111 scd_is_role_creator).",
      "A role opens nothing by itself: the Direzione loads it into a person's checklist, chooses that person's teams or site and saves it as person grants (r100).",
      "A team role sees only the teams chosen for that person; a responsabile sees more teams, areas or platforms only as granted one by one by the Direzione.",
      "Grants need the base access first: an active account of the club with a verified link (r111 trigger); revoking or narrowing is never blocked."
